# What a `*..*T` parameter of d stars reaches through the whole argument at token at, from the tokens — the twin of
# `_ic_pp_arg`'s sources: `&name` of a name declared with d - 1 stars, a name declared with d (a local's or a
# parameter's annotation: `0 - (k + 1)`, k the type past its stars; a global's step word: the struct, `_ic_pp_deep`), a
# field chain whose leaf is declared with d (its word), a call declared with d (a generic's `: *..*U` at what U binds
# here), wrapped (6.7.15's D22 A), or pointer arithmetic on one of them (D23 A). 0 = none — a missed flag, never a
# false one. CHANGELOG [6.7.16]
# 6.7.17: a field / method chain on any receiver head as the parser reads it (`_acv_bind` mode 2 + d), so the scan types
